    <p>This page is a free library of B2B marketing frameworks, templates, checklists, and calculators used in active fractional CMO engagements -- covering ICP definition, GTM strategy, demand generation, CAC/LTV measurement, content marketing, and revenue operations. All resources are ungated and free to use. For custom implementation, book a free strategy call at <a href="/book.html" style="color:#60a5fa;">markcmo.com/book.html</a>.</p>
  </div>
